        desc = "RX_INT_STATUS is an interrupt status register for the RX channel. (offset 0x10A8; total reset 0x00000000; PROVEN: Hi3516E V300 data sheet (Issue 00B06, 2019-05-15), section 11.1.6, PDF page 611).";
        field {
